Appearance demo icon sources

The artwork in src/components/AppearanceDemoIcon.astro is adapted from the
following official Lucide SVGs at commit:
70562c1ee1c4fdcf736fe97bc893fb8511927934
https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/tree/70562c1ee1c4fdcf736fe97bc893fb8511927934/icons

Light: sun.svg, with reversed ray path directions and a local stroke-dash reveal.
Its fixed center is retained; short idle rays extend to the normal Sun geometry.
Dark, Cloud clears: moon.svg, with an opaque, ink-filled cloud moving through
a cloud-only SVG clip, adapted from cloud.svg (scaled path geometry positioned
across the moon as cloud cover):
https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/blob/70562c1ee1c4fdcf736fe97bc893fb8511927934/icons/cloud.svg
Dark, Crescent to full: an adapted circular crescent construction with a moving
SVG mask and clipped inner outline. It reveals a full circle without moving or
scaling the moon's outer outline; it is not an unchanged official Lucide glyph.
System: monitor.svg outline retained throughout, with an added screen fill whose
idle brightness is opposite the device color-scheme preference and whose active
brightness matches it. The selected preview theme does not set this preference.

