This demo uses always-mounted native SVG geometry in one grid cell. Its local
stroke, cloud, mask and screen-fill transitions use 280ms CSS motion; it does not
execute or install the stock React/Motion animation components. Keyboard
selection and reduced-motion final states are immediate. The LICENSE is retained
unchanged.
